    {
      "zh": "歷史上有 Akman 等 protocol（每月吃 1 週），效果與成本介於 daily 與 low-dose 之間。臨床現況不普遍，reserve 給特殊耐受性差或長期維持的病人。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "p"
    },
    {
      "zh": "傳統 1986 年 Zachariae case series 建議停藥後 6-12 個月再做 ablative procedures；此後 6 個月成 dogma。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "p"
    },
    {
      "zh": "個案報告與小型研究有提及性慾下降、ED；機轉未明，可能與 sebum / mucocutaneous dryness 或 androgen 代謝有關。Practice：詢問、回報、必要時減量。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "p"
    },
    {
      "zh": "嚴重 nodulocystic acne 對其他治療無效",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "治療失敗的中度 acne(antibiotic ± topical retinoid 3-6 個月）",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "有顯著 scarring 風險或 PIH 的中度 acne（AAD 2024 已將適應症擴大，不再強求 nodular）",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "0.1–0.4 mg/kg/day(常見：每天 10-20 mg 固定劑量）",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Meta-analysis(Rasi 2014, Borghi 2011)顯示 efficacy 與 standard dose 相近，但 mucocutaneous AE 顯著降低、生活品質較佳。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "常用於：成人女性持續性 acne、low-grade inflammation、患者強烈要求美觀。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Optional:CBC、Cr、glucose（根據病人 comorbidity）",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "確認近 1 個月內未使用 tetracyclines",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Dry eye、blepharoconjunctivitis、減少 night vision、contact lens 不耐",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "避免 marathon、heavy lifting",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "頭痛 + visual change → fundoscopy + 神經科會診",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "ALT/AST 輕度升高 ~ 10-15%，通常 &lt; 3× ULN,reversible",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "TG 上升 ~ 25%;total cholesterol ~ 7-10%",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "TG &gt; 500 mg/dL → reduce dose / 飲食 / fenofibrate;&gt; 800 mg/dL → hold(pancreatitis 風險）",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "實務：詢問 baseline mental health；有 active major depression 者謹慎、監測 PHQ-9；出現症狀立即停藥評估。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "CYP3A4 inducers/inhibitors：臨床顯著性不大，因 iso 有多個代謝路徑。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "建議 baseline + 第 2 個月 LFT/lipid；低風險者後續間隔可拉長。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "女性 CBP β-hCG 每月仍建議。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Tetracycline 合併 → 禁忌。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Post-iso laser timing 採分層建議。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
    },
    {
      "zh": "Mental health screening 建議 at baseline,but 不支持「iso 直接造成 depression」的 causal claim。",
      "en": "",
      "tag": "li"
